FEATURE	FILTER()	MAP()
Type	Returns a New Array.	Returns a New Array.
Side Effect	Does not change the original array.	Changes the original array.
Use Case	Remove duplicates, find unique values.	Transform data (e.g., multiply by 2, shift left), create new lists.
Example	numbers.filter(x => x % 2 === 0) -> [2, 4, 6...]	numbers.map(x => x * 2) -> [2, 4, 6...]

